sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SRE
    participant Framework as oc adm must-gather<br/>Framework
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod<br/>(Ephemeral)
    participant GatherSH as gather.sh<br/>Orchestrator
    participant XKS as xks_util.sh<br/>Cluster Detection
    participant Scripts as Component Scripts<br/>(parallel)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LocalFS as /must-gather<br/>Local Filesystem
    participant Workstation as User Workstation

    User->>Framework: oc adm must-gather --image=must-gather-image
    Framework->>Pod: Launch ephemeral pod<br/>ServiceAccount: cluster-reader

    Pod->>GatherSH: Execute /usr/bin/gather

    GatherSH->>XKS: Detect cluster type
    XKS->>K8sAPI: Check API resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>XKS: API discovery response
    XKS-->>GatherSH: OpenShift / AKS / EKS / CKS

    GatherSH->>K8sAPI: Get RHOAI operator namespace<br/>via Subscription lookup
    K8sAPI-->>GatherSH: Operator namespace + CSV

    alt Full Collection (COMPONENT=all)
        GatherSH->>Scripts: Dispatch all component scripts<br/>(parallel execution)
    else Targeted Collection (COMPONENT=specific)
        GatherSH->>Scripts: Dispatch single component script
    end

    loop For each component
        Scripts->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect / kubectl_inspect<br/>Collect namespace resources
        K8sAPI-->>Scripts: Resources, logs, CRs
        Scripts->>LocalFS: Write collected data
    end

    GatherSH->>K8sAPI: Collect cluster-scoped CRDs<br/>(DSCInitialization, DataScienceCluster)
    K8sAPI-->>GatherSH: Cluster-scoped resources

    GatherSH->>K8sAPI: Collect Helm releases<br/>(helm get values/manifest)
    K8sAPI-->>GatherSH: Helm release data

    GatherSH->>LocalFS: Write all collected data

    Pod-->>Framework: Collection complete
    Framework->>Workstation: Copy /must-gather directory<br/>to user workstation
    Framework-->>User: must-gather archive ready
